{
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "RULE-MATCH-001",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-MATCH-001` Cycle order: Runtime Circuit → Wave Collapse → End-of-Cycle → Draft → End of Draft → New Cycle.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-MATCH-002",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-MATCH-002` New Cycle: End of Draft → New Cycle → Wallet reset → Location setup → Start-of-Cycle effects → Draw hand.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-MATCH-003",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-MATCH-003` End game: both Data Centers destroyed, or Cycle 16 ends. Cycle limit is configurable.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-MATCH-004",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-MATCH-004` Destruction during Collapse: finish the current Node, then stop. Do not continue to later Nodes. No Draft.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-MATCH-005",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-MATCH-005` Cycle-limit ending: final Draft occurs, then final VP is tallied.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-MATCH-006",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-MATCH-006` Highest VP wins. Equal VP is a tie.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-MATCH-007",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-MATCH-007` Players may concede. Concessions and forfeits are separate stats. Match Abandoned / Server Error counts in neither.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-DECK-001",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-DECK-001` Both players start with 10 cards: 5 Character, 3 Crypto, 2 VP.",
      "tags": [
        "rule",
        "starting-deck",
        "5-3-2"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-DECK-002",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-DECK-002` Cycle 1 uses the same shuffle/hand for both players. Later shuffles are independently random.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-DECK-003",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-DECK-003` Cycle 1 draws first 5. Cycle 2 draws remaining 5. If more cards are needed and Draw is empty, reshuffle Discard including acquired cards.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-DECK-004",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-DECK-004` All cards remaining in hand go to Discard at End of Cycle.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-DECK-005",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-DECK-005` `+N Cards` means Draw N. Gaining a card must name the gained card.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-CARD-001",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-CARD-001` Functional families: Character, VP, Crypto.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-CARD-002",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-CARD-002` Base and Chaos are current Character classifications. Schema must support future classifications.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-CARD-003",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-CARD-003` Character cards require 1 Action to deploy unless an approved effect changes it.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-CARD-004",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-CARD-004` VP cards are playable at Nodes and require no Action.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-CARD-005",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-CARD-005` Crypto cards are not playable at Nodes. Entering Draft auto-plays Crypto in hand, resolves text, then discards unless text says otherwise.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-CARD-006",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-CARD-006` Played Character and VP cards normally go to Discard after relevant resolution unless text says otherwise.",
      "tags": [
        "rule"
      ],
      "supersedes": [],
      "superseded_by": [],
      "document": "01_APPROVED_RULES.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "RULE-STARTER-001",
      "domain": "RULE",
      "status": "current",
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "text": "`RULE-STARTER-001` Slash-Dot: Power 3. `+3 Cards.` Cost 4.",
